---
// Session vs JWT: who remembers the login. Red = the part that matters:
// the self-contained token has no row to delete, so logout cannot reach it.
const W = 900, H = 330;
---
<figure class="bep7a">
  <div class="bep7a-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left: a browser holds a cookie with a session id, the server looks it up in a SESSIONS store, logout deletes the row and the next request returns 401. Right: a browser holds a signed token, the server only checks the signature, logout has nothing to delete and the same token still returns 200 until it expires.">
    <text x="225" y="26" text-anchor="middle" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>session: the server remembers</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>session: server nhớ</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="675" y="26" text-anchor="middle" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>JWT: the token remembers</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>JWT: token tự nhớ</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="52" width="170" height="78" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="105" y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>browser</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trình duyệt</tspan></text>
    <text x="105" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="mono">cookie: sid=Xk3…</text>
    <line x1="190" y1="91" x2="252" y2="91" class="ln" /><polygon points="260,91 250,86 250,96" class="hd" />
    <rect x="260" y="52" width="170" height="78" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="345" y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="nm">SESSIONS</text>
    <text x="345" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="mono">Xk3… → alice</text>

    <rect x="470" y="52" width="170" height="78" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="555" y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>browser</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trình duyệt</tspan></text>
    <text x="555" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="mono">sub · exp · signature</text>
    <line x1="640" y1="91" x2="702" y2="91" class="ln" /><polygon points="710,91 700,86 700,96" class="hd" />
    <rect x="710" y="52" width="170" height="78" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="795" y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>check signature</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kiểm chữ ký</tspan></text>
    <text x="795" y="104" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>no store, no lookup</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không store, không tra cứu</tspan></text>

    <text x="225" y="176" text-anchor="middle" class="bl"><tspan data-lang-en>logout deletes the row</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>logout xóa dòng đó</tspan></text>
    <line x1="225" y1="188" x2="225" y2="212" class="ln" /><polygon points="225,222 220,212 230,212" class="hd" />
    <rect x="115" y="226" width="220" height="56" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="225" y="250" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>next request: 401</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request kế: 401</tspan></text>
    <text x="225" y="271" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>revoked at once</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>thu hồi ngay</tspan></text>

    <text x="675" y="176" text-anchor="middle" class="bl"><tspan data-lang-en>logout: nothing to delete</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>logout: không có gì để xóa</tspan></text>
    <line x1="675" y1="188" x2="675" y2="212" class="bad" /><polygon points="675,222 670,212 680,212" class="badhd" />
    <rect x="565" y="226" width="220" height="56" rx="10" class="badbox" />
    <text x="675" y="250" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>same token: 200</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cùng token: 200</tspan></text>
    <text x="675" y="271" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>valid until exp</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>còn hạn tới exp</tspan></text>

    <line x1="450" y1="46" x2="450" y2="300" class="sep" />
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The trade in one picture. A session costs a lookup on every request and buys instant revocation. A JWT costs nothing per request and buys nothing at logout: the server has no row to remove. Both outcomes are the real status codes from the demo run.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cái giá đổi lấy, trong một hình. Session tốn một lần tra cứu mỗi request và đổi lại thu hồi được ngay. JWT không tốn gì mỗi request và cũng không làm được gì lúc logout: server không có dòng nào để xóa. Hai kết quả là status code thật từ lần chạy demo.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep7a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep7a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep7a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep7a text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .bep7a .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep7a .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep7a .bl { fill: var(--text-body); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep7a .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep7a .mono { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  .bep7a .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep7a .badbox { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .bep7a .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep7a .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep7a .bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep7a .badhd { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep7a .sep { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .bep7a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
